  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><article class=\"pb-12 md:pb-20\"><header class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 container mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-4 pb-8 lg:pb-0 lg:px-0 lg:pr-12 order-last lg:order-first\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-6xl\">\"The Final Race\" Collection</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"inline-block text-sm px-3 py-1 border border-black rounded-full\">Collections</span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 block mt-6\">Since its invention, the automobile has starred in many films around the world. If you are interested in cars, film, and culture, you now have a unique chance to bid on a collection of movie cars. Bidders Highway is honoured to present the first set of cars from the movie The Last Race. The collection consists of something for everyone. American, German, Japanese and of course Swedish!</span><div class=\"flex mt-6\"><div class=\"mr-2\"><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-full w-[48px]\" src=\"/assets/bidders-highway-63938c17.jpg\"></a></div><div><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\" class=\"block hover:underline\">Bidders Highway</a><span class=\"block text-neutral-500 text-sm\">December 21, 2023 12:00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 lg:mb-0\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/f21af71bbe84d187aad7586c2a461005\" width=\"1220\" height=\"840\"></div></div></header><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 my-8 lg:my-12\"><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 auction-body\"><div><br>This year's blockbuster is here! The action comedy <strong>Ett sista race</strong> starring, among others, David Hellenius and Malin Åkerman. The movie is set to premiere on the 25/12. The movie is about street racing legend Dennis (David Hellenius) who finds out that his daughter (Elsa Öhrn) is going to participate in an illegal race and sets out to stop her from participating. A movie filled with speed and humour, but above all cool cars!<br><br>Team Bidders Highway can now proudly present the first part of the impressive collection from the movie. The cars will be auctioned on the site during January and the closing is planned to take place at the end of the month. Part two of the auction will be presented in early 2024.<br><br><br>In the collection we find the protagonist's car, a 1967 Chevrolet Camaro in the classic combination of blue with white stripes, equipped with a souped up 327cui. For those who like to muscle cars, there is also a 1970 Dodge Challenger with a rugged race look. If you prefer more modern sports cars, there is a Mazda MX5 Miata, a Mercedes-Benz SL350 and a purple wrapped Porsche 996 4S. As the icing on the cake, the film production has also chosen to include a modified Swedish classic, a turbocharged Volvo Amazon. The collection really has something for everyone!</div></div><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 mt-10 lg:mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">0 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"></ul></div></div></div></article><div class=\"bg-black text-white py-10 spotlight-theme\" style=\"\n      background-image: linear-gradient(to top, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        linear-gradient(to right, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        url('https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/f21af71bbe84d187aad7586c2a461005');\n    \"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 \"><h3 class=\"text-neutral-400\">The collection</h3><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight max-w-lg mb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/ett-sista-race\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Ett Sista Race-samlingen</a></h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-lg mb-7\">Since its invention, the automobile has starred in many films around the world. If you are interested in cars, film, and culture, you now have a unique chance to bid on a collection of movie cars. Bidders Highway is honoured to present the first set of cars from the movie The Last Race. The collection consists of something for everyone. American, German, Japanese and of course Swedish!</p><div class=\"flex items-center font-medium gap-6\"><a href=\"/en/themes/ett-sista-race\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300\">View collection</a><a href=\"/en/posts/%22the-final-race%22-collection\" class=\"text-jaffa hover:text-zest\">Read the article</a></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-racing-700 text-white pb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/ett-sista-race\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Discover</a></h3><style>\n        #theme_264b7b67-ec6f-421a-a668-9be66ac6d146 { width: max(100%, 308%); }\n        @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {\n          #theme_264b7b67-ec6f-421a-a668-9be66ac6d146 { width: max(100%, 126%); }\n        }\n      </style><div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto snap-x\"><ul id=\"theme_264b7b67-ec6f-421a-a668-9be66ac6d146\" class=\"flex gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/chevrolet-camaro---ett-sista-race\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/d16b347a2d6b781093d3d5d23f82df8f\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1968 Chevrolet Camaro - Ett sista race HXY29G\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1968 Chevrolet Camaro - Ett sista race</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;